<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Nike cut by Merrill.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Nike cut by Merrill.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it downgraded Nike Inc to near-term neutral from accumulate. Merrill said it kept Nike's long-term rating as a buy.</p>
<p>-- Earlier on Thursday, Nike said it expects earnings for the fourth quarter ending May 31 to be between $0.51 a share and $0.56 a share, below analysts' consensus estimate of $0.69 a share.  Nike said the earnings will include a one-time, pre-tax charge equal to $0.04 a share.</p>
<p>-- Nike lost 8-1/8 to 55-1/2 in morning trading.</p>
